      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file encrypt_payload.py that encrypts a plaintext payload with a managed key, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I will use AWS KMS (Key Management Service) as the provider for this task. The code will import the boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with AWS KMS. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
